  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre XR3 is a distinctive multifilament string that combines several hundred microfilaments with three thicker monofilament cores to create a crisper and drier response than traditional multifilaments. It retains strong comfort, power and durability while offering a firmer impact feel. Liquid polyurethane impregnation improves comfort and performance, while the built-in wear indicator helps players identify when restringing is needed before complete breakage. XR3 is particularly popular in Japan.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre XR3 是一款结构非常特别的多芯球线，在数百根微纤维之外加入三根较粗的单丝核心，因此相比传统多芯线拥有更清脆、更偏干爽的击球反馈。它依然保留多芯线出色的舒适性、力量与弹性，同时增加一定的控制感和耐久性。球线通过液态聚氨酯整体浸润提升舒适度，并带有磨损指示功能，当击球区域出现明显起毛时，可提醒球员在完全断线前及时重新穿线。XR3 在日本市场尤其受欢迎。"
  },

